WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.840
Gochiso

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:14.270
I'm now collecting this month's rent,
16,000 yen, including board and utilities!

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.250
Mori Koji

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:22.840
Reflection beam!!

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.710
Ruru-san!
I'll make up for this sometime!

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:31.810
It's only a plastic bullet.

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:35.210
For crying out loud Mori Koji,
stop giving me so much trouble.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:35.960
Next!

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:38.600
Tofukuji

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:48.250
You've been doing the same act
for the last six months, old man.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:49.700
You're senile.

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:53.200
Please not that!

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:55.010
Give it up.

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:56.330
Please not that!!

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:56.360
Hibiki Amawa

00:00:57.170 --> 00:00:59.470
Here's the new boy.

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:03.290
Let's see what he has in store for me.

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:10.000
Ordinary people are always
harder to deal with.

00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:10.470
I'm out running.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:16.140
I, My, Me! - Strawberry-eggs

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:16.870
A blue sky before the end of the rainy season

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:16.870
Tsuyu ake mae no aozora wa...

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:24.790
makes a heart dance with expectation

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:24.790
hitoashi hayaku kokoro wo odoraseru

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:32.270
Summer is coming yet again

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:32.270
Kotoshi mo mosugu natsuga kuru

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:40.700
The city and people are coming to life bursting with joy

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:40.700
Machi mo hito mo ukare kibun de zawameki dasu

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:49.820
A man who's grown up without losing his boyish heart

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:49.820
Shonen no kokoro no mama otona ni natta hito

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:58.550
We can't go back to the day we met for the first time, but...

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:58.550
Futari deatta anohi ni modorenai kedo...

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:08.290
If I close my eyes, I can see your smiling face

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:08.290
Hitomi wo tojireba hohoemu kao ga mieru

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:12.170
The song we both loved. Do you still sing it?

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:16.200
Daisuki na ano uta. Ima mo utatte masuka?

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:14.570
So, that's going to
be my new workplace.

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:19.350
My life as a dedicated
kyoshi is to begin at last.

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:24.040
I can still hear that gentle voice and melody

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:24.040
Watashi ni wa kikoeru. Yasashii koe to melody

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:22.570
Here I come my students!

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:26.510
Well, maybe that's a little too cool.

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:33.320
During times of sadness, I will remember you

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:33.320
Yowaki na toki hodo anata wo omoidasu

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:28.590
I'd better get going.

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:31.090
Good morning!
Good morning!

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:32.060
Oh, oh, good morning!

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:34.190
Morning, how are you?
Good, good, good.

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:35.800
Morning, morning, morning.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:37.000
Who's that?

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.000
Morning!

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.740
Hot weather flushes out the weirdoes.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:41.930
Let's go.

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.000
He's so cool...

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:56.910
And then, yesterday, that Takeshi...

00:02:57.470 --> 00:02:58.990
That's no good.

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:11.040
Wait, wait!

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:21.690
Fukae-kun!

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:26.330
Thanks.

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:27.650
That was awesome.

00:03:30.530 --> 00:03:32.440
Well aren't you way cool!

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:34.470
I think she's falling for you.

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:38.100
That's not nice, Fukae-kun.

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:43.350
Fukae!! It's about time
you stop picking on Fuko!

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:45.290
Shut up!

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:48.090
Oh yeah? Say that again!

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:50.350
Fuko!!

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:54.590
Hey, are you OK?!

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.220
Oh, Fujio-chan.

00:03:57.850 --> 00:03:59.850
Now I don't have to look for a trash can.

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:02.810
You are something else.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:04.490
Let's go.

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:06.390
Hey, wait up, Akira!

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:15.820
Good morning!

00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:18.070
You are all here for breakfast?!

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:22.000
Great timing.
Can I introduce myself?

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.340
My name is Hibiki Amawa,
just moved in last night.

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:27.390
I graduated from university this spring...

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:29.910
with a certificate
as a physical education kyoshi!

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:31.640
Hurry, hurry!

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:37.350
The minds of today's youth
are being degenerated...

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:41.000
by too much emphasis on studying and
a disregard for physical education.

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:44.280
One must exercise
to feel the energy of life...

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:46.190
and must work up a sweat with others to!

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:49.940
Get your sweaty,
stinky foot off!

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:54.960
Well, I have to go to work. See you.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:59.940
Young man, can I have your
breakfast if you don't eat it?

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:01.610
No...

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:02.620
I can't?

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:10.310
What?

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:14.710
This month's rent is 16,000 yen,
including board and utilities!

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:19.170
Plus 1,000 yen for dog food.
I'll give you last night's rent for free.

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:21.710
Well, eh...

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:23.620
I don't have any money.

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:24.160
No?

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:26.460
Nothing at all?

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:33.360
Hey! Don't take Kura-Ge's food!

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:36.560
Kura-Ge? What kind of name is that?

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:38.690
The rent must be fully paid in advance!

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:41.130
If not, you'll have to leave!

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:42.610
Hey, wait a moment!

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:46.000
I had to use all my savings
for living expenses...

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:49.210
because I couldn't get a job
as a kyoshi, after graduation.

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:55.530
But I swear, I'll land a position this
time and get an advance on my salary.

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:57.420
Please, Ba-chan.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:58.970
Don't Ba-chan me!

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:02.280
Besides, I don't buy such shaky promises.

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:03.570
It's not shaky!

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:06.220
You know the junior high that's nearby?

00:06:06.870 --> 00:06:08.740
I'll go get a job right now!!

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:09.350
See you!!

00:06:11.610 --> 00:06:16.210
The junior high nearby?
That's Seitow Sannomiya Private School.

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:19.000
That's impossible.

00:06:20.030 --> 00:06:22.710
You're kidding!
This is your boyfriend, Miho?!

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:26.610
Yep! Nice body, don't you think?
He's a model.

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:29.480
But I think I'm better!

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:31.060
Stop it.

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:33.950
That's why you can't
find a boyfriend.

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.260
Hey, Fuko, what do you think?

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:38.120
Sexy, huh?

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:40.350
Ah, yeah... he's sexy.

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:42.050
You're not looking. Look, look.

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:42.940
Look, look.

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:44.280
No, stop...

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:44.660
Look, look.

00:06:44.510 --> 00:06:46.580
Stop it, Miho-chan!

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:50.850
Cut it out, Fuko's not ready
for that kind of stuff.

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:52.530
She's ready.

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:54.250
True love is a great thing.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:59.030
It's like your heart twinges,
feeling both happy and sad.

00:06:59.030 --> 00:06:59.760
Wow!

00:07:00.170 --> 00:07:02.240
Hey, don't just be impressed.

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:07.470
When you find someone you like,
you've really gotta go after them.

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:12.640
I wish I could, but I'm too slow.

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:15.340
Whether you can actually
run or not, doesn't matter.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:19.300
When the time comes,
your body will move on its own accord.

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:22.590
It will? That'll be great.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:25.010
What are you ladies talking about?

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:27.060
Oh, Seiko-chan. Look.

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:30.270
N... naked!

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:43.410
Oops, Seiko is worse off than
Fuko when it comes to guys.

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:46.880
Oh, that's right.
Seiko-chan, I'm sorry.

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:51.330
Principal's Office

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:53.700
This is the Principal's office, right?

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:58.170
A man. Such rudeness!
What is the meaning of this?!

00:07:58.270 --> 00:07:59.620
I'm very sorry!

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:02.110
This man demands
an audience with you.

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:05.710
I'd like to be a kyoshi!
A physical education kyoshi!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.430
A physical education kyoshi?

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:10.920
Yes! I heard there was
an opening at this school.

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:13.440
You better try other schools.

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:14.060
Huh?

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:17.520
You seem to know nothing
about this school.

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:22.400
We do not hire any male kyoshi
at our school.

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:23.020
What?

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:27.050
Teaching is an occupation
allowed solely to females...

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:31.840
the gender that detests fighting and
is capable of great maternal love.

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:34.340
Being a co-ed school
since its foundation...

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:36.300
we do have some
male students, of course.

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:38.690
However, we will reduce
their numbers gradually.

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:43.350
Nothing good comes from males,
even if they are given an education.

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:47.380
Trusting our precious students
to a stupid male is unthinkable.

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:51.340
Our motto is "Ai Isshin" (Love is All).
Nothing else.

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:54.710
Hey you! That's too extreme!

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:56.930
Men have love in their hearts!

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:58.650
A great love!!

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:08.250
Men!

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:12.220
For ten years, since that
frigid hag became the Principal...

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:15.390
no man has ever been hired.

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:17.890
Yeah, I can believe it.

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:20.680
And? Are you ready to leave?

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:24.380
No. I feel I have to fight this.

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:29.000
I can't back out when someone says
men aren't capable of love!

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.070
Well, well.

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:31.910
But she is a tough opponent.

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:33.140
All the better.

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:38.100
I'll become the first male kyoshi in
ten years and prove that Principal wrong!

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:45.110
You're going to teach her a lesson?
That's an interesting idea. I like that.

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:49.400
I'm saying I'll help you. Come on!
On the double, move it!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.610
Ba-chan, who are you, really?

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.110
Don't call me that!!

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:59.690
Wow! What a...

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:04.790
How you look isn't important.

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:09.720
The point is to make that woman
hire you as a teacher, right?

00:10:10.070 --> 00:10:11.550
Well, yeah, but...

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:14.760
So are you game or not?

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:22.140
Stupid males...

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:25.970
I'll do it!!

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:27.460
Good!!

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:05.100
Put this on.

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:06.300
What's this?

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:08.480
Your voice is the biggest problem.

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:10.940
Turn on the switch at the throat.

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:16.320
What?

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:17.920
A voice converter.

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:21.080
I was a doctor of electrical
engineering, a long time ago.

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:27.910
Unbecoming!!

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:41.470
Nice!

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:47.390
All right!
Go get the job and earn the rent!

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:50.010
OK! See you, Ba-chan!!

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:52.370
I said, don't "Ba-chan" me!!

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:58.500
I hear you are seeking a position
as a kyoshi at our school.

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:00.590
My name is Hibiki Amawa.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:03.230
Thank you for giving
me this opportunity.

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:09.090
Why does only Fuko have to
go to gym class at lunch break?

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:13.280
I'm not sure, but I heard it's a
mock class for a sensei-candidate.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.610
Oh yeah?

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:17.220
Oh, it is an important assignment.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:20.820
But out of all us students, why Fuko?

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.230
Are you all right?

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:32.560
Fuko...

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:36.630
Lunch break will be over
if you don't hurry.

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:38.110
Yeah...

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:44.840
Wow!

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:48.430
A tall woman!
She must be at least six feet.

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:51.180
But that's good for a gym teacher.

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:52.580
Amawa-san.

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:53.790
Yes.

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:56.830
Let us begin the mock class.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:57.460
Yes.

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:00.340
What are you doing?
We are waiting for you!

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:01.270
Yes!

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:05.130
Excuse me, but are those gym clothes?

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:06.100
That is correct.

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:11.450
We must not provoke the
stupid males during class.

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:15.500
I'm sorry.

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:18.940
I'm Fuko Kuzuha.
Nice to meet you.

00:13:19.850 --> 00:13:20.900
Oh, nice to meet you.

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:26.740
How can they move in those?
How archaic.

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:33.320
She must be thinking
I look really slow.

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:40.790
Shall we begin?

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:42.540
Vice-Principal...

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:46.220
Oh, yes. You are to conduct
a track-and-field class.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.090
You shall...

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:51.990
coach Fuko Kuzuha, so that she
can run 50m without falling down.

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:54.300
Is that all?

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:56.450
Yes, that is all.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:04.720
When it comes to a physical education
kyoshi, some women are rough like men.

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:06.960
"Ai Isshin"!
(Love is all!)

00:14:07.100 --> 00:14:11.080
We shall examine whether you're capable
of teaching, while following our motto.

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:19.880
Well, let's get started.

00:14:20.680 --> 00:14:21.590
Yes.

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:30.140
Let's try it once, then!

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:31.340
Yes!

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:33.210
On your mark!

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:35.810
Get set!

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:43.070
I... I'm sorry.

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:47.710
She's never finished a course
without falling down, has she?

00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:48.580
Guess not.

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:51.490
Don't get tensed up. Try again.

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:52.830
Yes!

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:53.660
Get set!

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:00.910
Well, one more time.

00:15:05.610 --> 00:15:06.640
Oh, no.

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:07.890
Here.

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:12.970
Hold your arms at 90 degrees
and swing back and forth.

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:16.010
Bend forward a little
and pull your thighs up like this.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:21.480
Ooh! I'm teaching!
I'm being a kyoshi!

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:23.570
Uh... sensei?

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:26.690
Oh, sorry.

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:29.000
And don't look down.

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:31.700
Keep your eyes on the
finish line at all times.

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.800
You can do it, OK?

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.000
OK!

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:39.060
On your mark!

00:15:39.650 --> 00:15:40.360
Get set!

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:53.500
Look ahead.

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:55.070
Arms at 90 degrees.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:56.180
Thighs...

00:15:56.520 --> 00:16:00.660
Not very outstanding coaching
by any means, is it?

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:24.070
Well... Yamaha-san?

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:26.920
Ah, it's Kuzuha.

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:29.490
Oh, sorry.

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:30.820
Listen closely.

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:53.160
OK?

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:00.220
Yes!

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:32.090
I'm ready!

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:33.620
On your mark!

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:36.120
Get set!

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:14.990
Almost there! Hang on!!

00:18:17.160 --> 00:18:18.780
Now dive!!

00:18:58.440 --> 00:18:59.330
Great job!!

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:01.910
Sensei, thank you so much!

00:19:02.110 --> 00:19:02.950
Taraba!

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:06.290
It's Kuzuha.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.250
Fuko!!

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:11.010
Hey!!

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:12.630
Well done, Fuko.

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:13.580
Miho-chan!

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:16.680
Good job!
I didn't think you'd make it.

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:18.390
Thanks, Fujio-chan.

00:19:27.820 --> 00:19:29.060
Hey hey, Fuko.

00:19:29.190 --> 00:19:32.990
What did that sensei candidate say
when she whispered into your ear?

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:36.860
Oh, yeah, well...

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:39.860
You'll be fine.

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:47.200
Are you serious?!
That's not very sensei-like, but...

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:50.060
I'm surprised you did it,
when that's all she said.

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:51.010
That's OK!

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:53.570
She finished without flopping
for the first time.

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:55.670
Don't fuss over
a little thing like that!

00:19:55.930 --> 00:19:57.900
You're happy, aren't you Fuko?

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:00.490
What's this?

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:02.990
My heart is racing so fast.

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:08.010
She is a woman, yet...

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:10.010
Could it be that...

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:13.640
I'm in...

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:23.380
You passed the test.

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:27.510
Nonetheless, for Seitow Sannomiya
Junior High School, with its 52 years...

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:31.370
distinguished history of producing
well-mannered and graceful students...

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:33.150
a boisterous person
such as yourself is...

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:33.870
I'm sorry!

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:38.920
But, please, excuse me for
asking this right away but...

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:40.100
What is it?

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:42.930
May I ask for an
advance on my salary?

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:44.320
No, you may not!

00:20:44.580 --> 00:20:45.770
What?!

00:20:45.990 --> 00:20:48.860
Oh, please!

00:20:56.220 --> 00:21:01.020
He managed to get a job,
but he couldn't get a salary advance.

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:03.250
So, you're going to be
my hostage for a while.

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:06.760
If he doesn't pay the rent,
you are going to end up as Inu-nabe!

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:16.870
At the train station after school
that's where I look for you

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:16.870
Hokago no eki kimi wo sagasu.

00:21:16.980 --> 00:21:26.230
With my racing heart
can I find you again today?

00:21:16.980 --> 00:21:26.230
Doki doki shiteru
kyo mo aeru kana?

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:48.190
At this train station
I saw you many times before

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:48.190
Eki no homu de
mikakete ta kimi.

00:21:48.350 --> 00:21:55.080
But couldn't talk to you
Not at all

00:21:48.350 --> 00:21:55.080
Hajime wa nanimo hanase nakatta.

00:21:55.230 --> 00:22:01.930
Will I find you again tomorrow?

00:21:55.230 --> 00:22:01.930
Moshimo ashita aetara iina?

00:22:02.070 --> 00:22:09.910
Maybe I'll have enough
courage to talk to you

00:22:02.070 --> 00:22:09.910
Youki dashite ieru kamone.

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:17.040
Even if the sky cries

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:17.040
Tatoeba sora ga namida shitemo...

00:22:17.040 --> 00:22:25.880
with your smile it's
a sunny day in my eyes

00:22:17.040 --> 00:22:25.880
kimi no egao de hitomi wa hareru yo.

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:53.230
Second Period "Forbidden Narrow Eyeliner"

00:22:38.610 --> 00:22:41.740
The theme for today's homeroom is "Boke (Comic) & Tsukkomi (Straight-Man) Part 2".

00:22:41.740 --> 00:22:44.310
When I do the Boke (Comic) part,
you do the Tsukkomi (Straight-man), OK?

00:22:43.270 --> 00:22:44.310
Nande ya nen.
(Nyah-Nyah.)

00:22:44.310 --> 00:22:46.840
Not yet! You are such
a fidget, aren't you?

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:49.080
Just like the people in this homeroom.

00:22:49.080 --> 00:22:50.040
Nande ya nen.
(Nyah-Nyah.)

00:22:50.040 --> 00:22:51.450
Well, there's no real punch line.

00:22:51.450 --> 00:22:52.710
Nande ya nen?
(Nyah-Nyah?)
